  "description": "If you’re seeking a 32-inch-wheel bike for gravel, bikepacking, and beyond, the Fargo 32 titanium frameset lets you build on Fargo’s legendary capability. We paired our 3/2.5 seamless triple-butted titanium tubing with a carbon fiber fork for a supportive, efficient, and durable ride. This frameset is designed to roll on 32\" wheels, which boost the bike’s stability, deliver more traction, and carry more speed and momentum. The resulting ride lets you cover more-rugged terrain more quickly, worrying less about line choice and long days. Fargo’s many cargo mounts adapt to any adventure that lies ahead, from local overnighters accessible only by singletrack to rugged bikepacking races on the other side of the world. This versatile frameset comes equipped with our UDH-compatible Alternator dropouts, with the ability to run a variety of hubs drivetrains using different Alternator plates (sold separately). The Fargo 32 titanium frameset is the perfect foundation for your dream-machine 32 inch-wheel bike — build it up and ride off on your biggest, boldest adventures yet.",
